/****** UP-Text.mcc/UPA_Text_Contents ******
*
*   NAME
*       UPA_Text_Contents -- attribute of UP-Text.mcc
*
*   FUNCTION
*       STRPTR copied into the object; redraws only when it changed
*
*   INPUTS
*       UPA_Text_Contents - access ISG. Tag value from <mcc/up.h>.
*
*   RESULT
*       Read with GetAttr/get(), set with SetAttrs/set() or in the MUI_NewObject tag list, as the access letters allow (I = initial, S = set, G = get).
*
*   SEE ALSO
*       <mcc/up.h>, UP-Text.mcc
*
******/

/****** UP-Text.mcc/UPA_Text_Widest ******
*
*   NAME
*       UPA_Text_Widest -- attribute of UP-Text.mcc
*
*   FUNCTION
*       STRPTR longest text the line shows (default width); absent = contents
*
